  "description": "Alibaba Qwen-Image 2512 (20B, fp8): text to image with realistic people, fine natural detail and accurate text layout. The 4-step Lightning LoRA is on by default; turn it off for the full 50-step run. About 32 GB of weights; ComfyUI offloads them on 12 GB GPUs.",
